#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:92
msgid "## Edge Cases"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:101
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Scenario                           | Handling                                                                 |\n"
"| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Overnight (22:30 → next day 09:15) | Each user message has full `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm`                            |\n"
"| Multiple user messages same day    | Each gets prefix (no interval omission)                                  |\n"
"| Long gap (travel/holiday)          | Messages after return still injected by respective timestamp             |\n"
"| Brand new conversation             | First user message also prefixed                                         |\n"
"| After compression                  | Compression summary time anchor TBD; subsequent messages inject normally |\n"
"| No timestamp                       | Skip, no injection                                                       |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:103
msgid "## Out of Scope"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:109
msgid ""
"❌ Do not compute and inject elapsed duration (e.g. \"8 hours passed\")—"
"Agent can derive from timestamps"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:109
msgid "❌ Do not modify persisted PG messages"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:109
msgid "❌ Do not show time prefix in WebUI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:109
msgid ""
"❌ Do not give built-in time-passing sense—that is biological, not simulated"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/time-perception.md:109
msgid ""
"❌ Do not inject \"current time\" in system prompt (main conversation relies "
"on per-user `time` lines)"
msgstr ""

